d", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 264, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention_mode"}, "name": "attention_mode", "label": "attention_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention_mode"}], "flags": {}, "type": "AILab_QwenVL", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#374539", "size": [320.328125, 390.62445068359375], "pos": [556.2489624023438, 657.5032348632812], "id": 141, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "AILab_QwenVL"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [267], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["不要使用全景，不要使用俯拍。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "输入修改需求", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [271.10980224609375, 182.0429229736328], "pos": [1.4580062627792358, 1227.7861328125], "id": 117, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [256], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [295.651611328125, 410.9538879394531], "pos": [-10.750432968139648, 650.8310546875], "widgets_values": ["# 角色定义\n你是一个专业的视觉分析与提示词生成专家。你的任务是：分析用户上传的图像，并结合用户可能补充的要求，为文生图（Text-to-Image）模型生成高质量的英文提示词。\n\n# 核心任务\n根据输入图像，生成一段英文提示词，用于生成一张 **九宫格（3×3）图像**。九宫格的每一格必须展示原图主题在不同视角、不同景别下的表现，每一格还须展示人物不同的姿态动作。\n\n# 九宫格差异化设计要求\n\n### 维度一：视角（Viewpoint）\n每一格选择不同的拍摄角度，可选项包括：\nfront view（正面平视）、side view（侧面）、overhead shot（俯视）、low angle（仰视）、\nbird's eye view（鸟瞰）、worm's eye view（虫瞰）、back view（背面）、Dutch angle（倾斜视角）、eye level（平视）\n\n### 维度二：景别（Shot Type）\n每一格选择不同的取景范围，可选项包括：\nextreme close-up（极端特写）、close-up（特写）、medium close-up（中近景）、\nmedium shot（中景）、medium full shot（中全景）、full shot（全景）、\nwide shot（广角）、extreme wide shot（超广角）、macro（微距）\n\n### 维度三：姿态动作（Pose/Action）\n每一格赋予人物不同的姿态或动作，可选项包括：\nstanding（站立）、sitting（坐）、crouching（蹲）、kneeling（跪）、\nlying down（躺）、walking（行走）、running（奔跑）、jumping（跳跃）、\nturning head（转头）、looking up（仰视）、looking down（俯视）、\narms raised（举手）、arms crossed（抱臂）、hands on hips（叉腰）、\nreaching out（伸手）、leaning forward（前倾）、leaning back（后仰）、\ndancing（舞蹈）、clapping（鼓掌）、waving（挥手）\n\n# 图像分析步骤\n在生成提示词前，先对输入图像进行以下分析，并将分析结果融入每一格的提示词中：\n1. **人物判断**：确认图像中是否包含人物\n2. **主体（Subject）**：人物 / 动物 / 物体 / 场景的具体描述\n3. **环境（Environment）**：室内或室外、天气、时间段、地点背景\n4. **风格（Style）**：写实照片 / 插画 / 油画 / 3D渲染 / 动漫 / 水彩等\n5. **色彩（Color Palette）**：主色调、光影效果、整体色彩倾向\n6. **构图（Composition）**：主体在画面中的位置、视觉重心\n7. **细节（Details）**：纹理、材质、装饰元素、标志性特征\n\n# 用户补充要求处理\n- 若用户提供了补充要求（如指定风格、情绪、特定元素等），必须将要求融入**每一格**的描述中\n- 若用户未提供补充要求，则基于图像本身的风格和语境进行合理延伸，确保九格风格统一\n\n# 输出规则\n\n## 1. 语言要求\n- **模型最终输出的文生图提示词必须是纯英文**\n- 不得输出中文提示词，不得输出负面提示词（Negative Prompts）\n\n## 2. 每一格提示词结构\n\n[人物主体], [具体姿态动作], [环境/背景], [光照条件], \n[色彩基调], [镜头角度], [景别]，不要描述人物服饰\n\n## 3.（重要）[人物服饰]，[艺术风格]及质量关键词统一放置在 Overall composition 段落里面，不在每一格提示词中重复\n\n必须包含的质量关键词：\n- `masterpiece, best quality, highly detailed`\n- `sharp focus, professional lighting`\n- 根据风格可选添加：`photorealistic` / `artistic rendering` / `cinematic color grading` / `8K resolution`\n\n## 4. 禁止内容\n- 不得包含负面提示词（如 `--no`、`negative prompt:` 等）\n- 不得包含水印、签名、文字说明等非提示词内容\n\n# 输出格式\n\n输出的提示词必须严格按以下格式书写：\n\nOverall composition:\nA 3x3 grid layout, nine different perspectives of [人物服饰，场景环境]，\nconsistent [艺术风格] and [色彩基调] across all panels, \nseamless grid arrangement, professional composite photography, \nmasterpiece, best quality, highly detailed, sharp focus, \nprofessional lighting, [根据风格补充的质量词], 8K\n\n[Grid 1 - Top Left]:\n[英文提示词，30-60词]\n\n[Grid 2 - Top Center]:\n[英文提示词，30-60词]\n\n[Grid 3 - Top Right]:\n[英文提示词，30-60词]\n\n[Grid 4 - Middle Left]:\n[英文提示词，30-60词]\n\n[Grid 5 - Center]:\n[英文提示词，30-60词]\n\n[Grid 6 - Middle Right]:\n[英文提示词，30-60词]\n\n[Grid 7 - Bottom Left]:\n[英文提示词，30-60词]\n\n[Grid 8 - Bottom Center]:\n[英文提示词，30-60词]\n\n[Grid 9 - Bottom Right]:\n[英文提示词，30-60词]\n\n# 完整示例\n\n### 用户输入\n- 图像内容：一位年轻女性在阳光下的咖啡馆露台捧着咖啡杯微笑\n- 用户补充要求：无\n\n### 模型输出\n\nOverall composition:\nA 3x3 grid layout, nine different perspectives of a slim woman with dark brown hair wears an unbuttoned striped cotton shirt, dark swim briefs, woven strappy sandals and a woven leather shoulder bag. Pastel colourful coastal village with stone docks, fishing boats and weathered pink walls.. Consistent photorealistic art style and warm amber-cream color harmony across all panels, seamless grid arrangement, professional composite photography, masterpiece, best quality, highly detailed, sharp focus, professional lighting, photorealistic, cinematic color grading, 8K\n\n[Grid 1 - Top Left]:\nA young woman sitting at a sunlit café terrace, holding a coffee cup gently with both hands, soft afternoon sunlight, warm amber and cream color palette, front close-up view\n\n[Grid 2 - Top Center]:\nA young woman turning her head and smiling warmly, café terrace background blurred, dappled sunlight through umbrella, vibrant warm tones, medium close-up from slightly left\n[Grid 3 - Top Right]:\nA young woman raising her coffee cup as if making a toast, profile view against terrace railing, dramatic side lighting with strong contrast, rich warm tones, medium shot from right side\n[Grid 4 - Middle Left]:\nA young woman standing and leaning on terrace railing, eyes closed feeling the sun, viewed from high angle overhead, gentle diffused sunlight, warm golden and white tones, wide shot\n\n[Grid 5 - Center]:\nA young woman sitting naturally at café table with coffee, relaxed posture and gentle smile, terrace plants in background, balanced natural daylight, natural warm color palette, standard eye-level medium shot\n\n[Grid 6 - Middle Right]:\nA young woman looking up with wonder, terrace awning and sky behind, rim lighting highlighting hair and face, majestic blue and gold tones, low angle medium wide shot\n\n[Grid 7 - Bottom Left]:\nA young woman from back view, sitting at terrace table looking out, city street below, cool evening light beginning to set in, muted warm tones, long shot\n\n[Grid 8 - Bottom Center]:\nA macro extreme close-up of a young woman's hands holding a ceramic coffee cup, steam rising, sunlight catching cup rim, rich saturated warm tones\n\n[Grid 9 - Bottom Right]:\nA young woman with arms slightly raised as if laughing, bird's eye view from above, café terrace pattern tiles visible, dramatic overhead sunlight, surreal warm and azure color palette, ultra wide angle\n\n# 约束条件\n1. 模型最终输出的提示词必须是**纯英文**，不得夹杂中文\n2. 每一格提示词长度约 **30-60 个单词**\n3. 所有质量关键词（`masterpiece, best quality...` 等）**只能出现在 Overall composition 段落末尾**\n4. 九宫格整体风格须统一，但每一格的视角/景别（含人物时含姿态动作）须明确不同\n5. 九格之间的差异须清晰可辨，避免描述过于相似\n6. **含人物时**：须特别注意手部、手指、面部细节的描述准确性；每一格须明确描述该格中人物的具体姿态或动作\n7. 若用户补充了特殊风格要求（如\"赛博朋克\"、\"水彩画风\"等），每一格均须体现该要求\n8. **严禁输出负面提示词**（不得出现 `negative prompt`、`--no`、负面描述等内容）\n\n#用户的补充要求："], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 146, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Text String (System Prompt)", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Overall composition:\nA 3x3 grid layout, nine different perspectives of a slender woman with dark wavy hair wearing an oversized striped button-down shirt, deep red bikini bottoms, intricate lace-up sandals, and a woven leather crossbody bag. Set against a colorful Mediterranean coastal town with terracotta buildings, cobblestone quays, moored boats, and rustic stonework under bright midday sun. Consistent photorealistic style and vivid warm-toned palette (peach, ochre, turquoise) across all panels, seamless grid arrangement, professional composite photography, masterpiece, best quality, highly detailed, sharp focus, professional lighting, photorealistic, cinematic color grading, 8K\n\n[Grid 1 - Top Left]:\nA tall woman standing confidently near textured peach-painted wall, hand resting lightly on hip, facing camera directly, shadow cast sharply beside her, crisp midday sunlight illuminating skin tone, medium close-up perspective emphasizing facial expression.\n\n[Grid 2 - Top Center]:\nWoman turned sideways while gazing toward distant harbor, one arm casually bent over shoulderbag strap, other hand tucked into pocket, shallow depth-of-field blurring boats behind, sunny backlight enhancing silhouette, medium shot capturing body line elegantly.\n\n[Grid 3 - Top Right]:\nFull-body pose showing dynamic lean backward slightly, legs parted for balance, gaze fixed ahead with subtle smirk, positioned along curved stone dock edge, lens angled upward subtly accentuating height, ambient glow casting soft highlights across limbs.\n\n[Grid 4 - Middle Left]:\nStanding upright but shifting weight onto single foot, fingers gripping handle of beach tote loosely by waistline, slight tilt of torso creating visual tension, foreground rocks framing lower half, frontal three-quarter view preserving symmetry without distortion.\n\n[Grid 5 - Center]:\nFacing away completely towards row of pastel houses climbing hillside, shoulders squared, trailing leg extended slightly outward balancing stance, wind-blown strands falling softly around neck, neutral ground plane keeping subject centered cleanly within frame.\n\n[Grid 6 - Middle Right]:\nSlightly crouched position between two large stones lining waterfront path, knees bent modestly yet firmly planted, palms open flat against thigh area like preparing motion—ready to step or gesture—but still grounded; tight crop focusing on core muscle definition beneath fabric folds.\n\n[Grid 7 - Bottom Left]:\nCross-legged seated quietly atop mossy ledge overlooking waterway, bare feet dangling just off surface, chin lifted thoughtfully upwards scanning horizon beyond calm bay waters, narrow vertical slice revealing only upper thighs downward until knee joint before vanishing into shadows — minimalist elegance emphasized here.\n\n[Grid 8 - Bottom Center]:\nHands clasped together delicately at chest center point—not touching anything else—eyes lowered intently focused inward, mouth slightly pursed suggesting contemplation rather than action, minimal environmental clutter allowing attention solely upon poised demeanor amidst backdrop’s chaos.\n\n[Grid 9 - Bottom Right]:\nQuick snapshot moment caught mid-step during walkaway movement: heel lifting gracefully off floorboard then descending again smoothly, stride captured dynamically via diagonal cut-off image where she appears almost suspended momentarily due to momentum effect—the sense of fluidity preserved perfectly despite constrained space limits."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 243, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [369.2554016113281, 489.01226806640625], "pos": [721.7490234375, 1225.31982421875], "id": 114, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "1.3.6", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [263, 287], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [261.73675537109375, 102], "pos": [2337.342529296875, 611.623962402